    "details": {
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p><em>Infernalis chroma.</em> A devil muse who fights with an enchanted paintbrush staff, cycling rune-painted masks each turn and flinging enchanted paint as spells. Its lair, the Chroma Cavern, repaints reality itself around intruders. Nothing pleases a painted lady more than myths of tragic heroes with artistic flair. Habitat: Extraplanar.</p><p><strong>Gear:</strong> paintbrush staff (Quarterstaff).</p><p><em>Source: Heliana's Field Notes X-20 (Loot Tavern)</em></p>",
        "public": ""
