      "type": "feat",
      "system": {
        "description": {
          "value": "<p><strong>Ability:</strong> Charisma; <strong>DC:</strong> 19; <strong>Modifier:</strong> +11. The painted lady uses its paintbrush staff as a Spellcasting Focus. Its spells fling powerful enchanted paint at their targets.</p><p><strong>At Will:</strong> <em>Acid Splash</em> (level 11 caster), <em>Corrupting Ichor</em>*, <em>Minor Illusion</em></p><p><strong>4/Day:</strong> <em>Acid Arrow</em>, <em>Color Spray</em>, <em>Hypnotic Pattern</em> (C)</p><p><strong>3/Day:</strong> <em>Acid Rain</em>* (C), <em>Major Image</em> (C)</p><p><strong>1/Day Each:</strong> <em>Phantasmal Killer</em> (C), <em>Prismatic Spray</em> (C)</p><p>*See the spell pages of the Field Notes PDF; (C) indicates Concentration.</p>",
